 "text": "So who decided, and who paid? The change made one detail simpler to fabricate and install. That was the entire upside. The downside was a wave of lawsuits from victims and their families. Missouri's licensing authorities found the engineer of record and the project engineer grossly negligent. Both lost their engineering licences in Missouri, and their firm lost its certificate to practise engineering in the state.",
